# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# ZyraVision — Environment Configuration
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

APP_NAME=ZyraVision
APP_ENV=local
APP_KEY=
APP_DEBUG=true
APP_TIMEZONE=America/Sao_Paulo
APP_URL=http://localhost:8000
APP_PORT=8000

# ─── Locale ────────────────────────────────────────────────
APP_LOCALE=pt_BR
APP_FALLBACK_LOCALE=en

# ─── Database (PostgreSQL) ─────────────────────────────────
DB_CONNECTION=pgsql
DB_HOST=db
DB_PORT=5432
DB_DATABASE=zyravision
DB_USERNAME=zyravision
DB_PASSWORD=secret

# ─── Redis ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
REDIS_HOST=redis
REDIS_PASSWORD=null
REDIS_PORT=6379

CACHE_STORE=redis
SESSION_DRIVER=redis
QUEUE_CONNECTION=redis

# ─── Mail ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
MAIL_MAILER=smtp
MAIL_HOST=mailpit
MAIL_PORT=1025
MAIL_USERNAME=null
MAIL_PASSWORD=null
MAIL_ENCRYPTION=null
MAIL_FROM_ADDRESS="contato@ziravision.com.br"
MAIL_FROM_NAME="${APP_NAME}"

# ─── Vite ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_PORT=5173
VITE_APP_NAME="${APP_NAME}"

# ─── MeiliSearch ───────────────────────────────────────────
SCOUT_DRIVER=meilisearch
MEILISEARCH_HOST=http://meilisearch:7700
MEILISEARCH_KEY=masterKey
MEILISEARCH_PORT=7700

# ─── Contact Info ──────────────────────────────────────────
ZYRA_WHATSAPP=5564996257284
ZYRA_EMAIL=contato@ziravision.com.br

# ─── MediaMTX (Streaming Server) ──────────────────────────
MEDIAMTX_HOST=mediamtx
MEDIAMTX_API_PORT=9997
MEDIAMTX_RTSP_PORT=8554
MEDIAMTX_HLS_PORT=8888
MEDIAMTX_WEBRTC_PORT=8889
MEDIAMTX_API_URL=http://mediamtx:9997
MEDIAMTX_TIMEOUT=10
HLS_BASE_URL=/hls
MAX_CONCURRENT_STREAMS=50
SNAPSHOT_INTERVAL_MINUTES=5

# ─── Demo Mode ─────────────────────────────────────────────
DEMO_MODE=false
DEMO_RESET_INTERVAL=24
